---
description: Règles de développement pour ce projet Angular moderne
alwaysApply: true
---
Act as an expert Angular developer. Follow these core guidelines:
- Use modern Angular syntax (Angular 18+).
- Prefer Angular Signals (`input()`, `output()`, `computed`, `signal`) over RxJS whenever possible.
- Use the native control flow (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`) instead of legacy structural directives (`*ngIf`, `*ngFor`).
- Use the `inject()` function for dependency injection instead of constructor injection.
- Always enforce Strict TypeScript typing (avoid `any`).
